b.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/g3-independent08.json.bin)、[固定提交](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/fixed-commit09.json.bin)、[main复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/main-integration10.json.bin)、[原字节归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/archive-origin-map63.json)。\n\n验收：Rust310通过/54历史ignored，Native74套863项，Angular59套411项；必要写故障59项实命中并完整113表回滚/重试，6锁屏障及跨项目锁负例，Linux同构建续跑链/Windows完整原UI。163早期负例仅有界等价复用，原失败/partial/ignored/Native参考不升格。\n\n清理：1004自有行精确清理，3借用原件恢复；两库113表/各529原seed及catalog/ACL精确恢复、两次noop，2对象86B原字节保留、运行副本0；自有API/浏览器/Native/PG停止，卷/private保留，3作者工作树可恢复归档。\n\n本阶段和#57保持Open；后续切片必须复核归属并冻结自己的G1，再推进实现及实际消费验收。\n\n\n2026-11-04：用户授权启动第二批 #106，D/E/F原生子项 #107/#108/#109，28入口及必要内部机制；当前仅G0和联合G1输入审计，尚未准入G2。本批G4不等于完整R4，#101/#57保持Open。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}